# Read by Flux's source-controller when it packs this repo into the
# artifact every Kustomization builds from. Its built-in exclusions drop
# images (*.png, *.jpg, ...) from that artifact even though they are in
# git, so a configMapGenerator that ships a PNG fails with "no such file
# or directory" (open-webui, 2026-11-22). Patterns here are evaluated after
# the built-in ones, so a negation re-includes exactly the files a
# Kustomization needs.

# Open WebUI workspace model icons (workspace/kustomization.yaml)
!/kubernetes/apps/open-webui/open-webui/app/workspace/icons/*.png
